| \x1b[1mHelp\x1b[m - Advanced settings                                                                         |
|                                                                                                  |
| up/down     setting                                                                              |
| Esc         close                                                                                |
| ?/F1        help                                                                                 |
| Ctrl+C      exit                                                                                 |
|                                                                                                  |
| Editors change the plan at once and run the checks again; every other flag from the command line |
| is carried as given. Esc returns to the choices. Nothing has been changed yet: nothing on these  |
| screens changes anything until you approve the plan on the review. Ctrl+C exits.                 |
